  "worked_solution": "In the case of exponential dependence, the points on the plot should be scattered along a curve whose $y$-values increase or decrease rapidly.\n\nAmong the given options, the only scatter plot that fits the description is the following:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14226611/assets/b40de1f74b96a981e9588e63689a766fabef65f4c3f661ebf6f4d2c59e4cd3cc.png)",
